6. Used but not included
------------------------

- Inter (SIL Open Font License) is the optional fallback font. It comes from
  the npm package @fontsource-variable/inter and is not in the repository.
- Base UI (@base-ui/react), React and the development tools are npm
  dependencies under their own licences; package-lock.json names each one.
- The Ferrite SDK (ferrite-app, ferrite-app-test) is taken by path from a
  checkout of https://github.com/iGentAI/ferrite-sdk (MIT) and is not in the
  repository.
- A deployed desktop fetches public content at run time through the
  destinations declared in ferrite-apps/desktop/ferrite.json (for example
  Project Gutenberg, Standard Ebooks, Wiktionary, Wikipedia, the Internet
  Archive, news feeds, podcast feeds and OpenStreetMap). None of that content
  is in the repository; each application credits its sources in its window.

